## Define-Review an existing documentation question-answer format

Define in terms of standard use case scenarios the intended purpose and audience to be served by this documentation QA format. For example, 

1. provide quick access to relevant references; 
2. easily copy and paste link; 
3. limit editing;

and similar features which make for quick accessibility and ease of use, or which remove barriers to accessing the full content.

